BT /F3 7.5 Tf 54 177.5 Td (  - UI assets, auth, trusted devices, pairing, tunnels, relay) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 54 167.5 Td (  - Git, filesystem, terminal, previews, notifications) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 54 157.5 Td (  - API validation, event fan-out, remote-host selection) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 54 147.5 Td (                         |) Tj ET
