BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 594.5 Td (- Follow Pi's no-permission-popup default. PiChamber does not add a mandatory confirmation before every) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 583 Td (  Bash, edit, or write tool call in this phase.) Tj ET
