BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 537 Td (  launches separate Pi work. Subagents therefore wait for the extension-support milestone.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 54 500.5 Td (Sessions, concurrency, and recovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 467.5 Td (- Trusted paired clients have equal control of a shared session.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 456 Td (- One session has one active Pi run at a time. Incoming user input while running is explicitly routed as) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 444.5 Td (  steering or follow-up work according to PiChamber queue behavior.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 433 Td (- The session daemon publishes authoritative snapshots and sequenced transient events. The client must use) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 421.5 Td (  a snapshot plus sequence watermark on reconnect, then resume deltas without duplicating or dropping) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 410 Td (  streamed content.) Tj ET
