BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 387 Td (- A planned daemon restart should wait for sessions to settle when practical.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 375.5 Td (- A daemon crash or forced daemon restart interrupts active runs. PiChamber must mark them interrupted,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 364 Td (  reload persisted Pi sessions, and resync clients. It must never display stale partial output as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 352.5 Td (  successful completion.) Tj ET
