BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 329.5 Td (  only sidecar keyed to Pi session identity/path. Archive hides sessions only in PiChamber and never) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 54 318 Td (  modifies Pi JSONL or Pi CLI listing behavior.) Tj ET
